 ('Wi-Fi', 'Working; throughput needs work', 'Scanning, connection, internet and authorized debugging work. Local synthetic SSH transfers remain slow; a 1 MiB test completed at 1.22 Mbit/s toward the PC and 1.65 Mbit/s toward the phone, including SSH startup. Power-save disable did not help; original setting restored. Connection recovered after the two-minute sleep.', 'Investigate throughput, factory MAC, roaming and repeated suspend recovery. Advertised monitor mode has not been functionally tested.'),
 ('Bluetooth', 'Partial', 'User paired and connected a peripheral; discovery and power-on work.', 'Controller sleep workaround remains. Audio profiles and reconnect after sleep need testing.'),
 ('Speakers and microphone', 'Working basics', 'User heard a clear speaker tone; microphone captured acoustic tone on both PCM channels and desktop recording passed.', 'Voice quality, startup transients, channel independence and headset/USB audio remain unvalidated.'),
 ('Main rear camera', 'Working basics / partial', 'Preview, photos, exposure, white balance and near/far focus user-verified. Faster autofocus takes about 1.7–2.4 seconds per search in logs; user confirms sharpness. Startup timing fix passed three rebind cycles and one normal reboot. User confirms upright video playback with sound.', 'OIS, synchronized still flash, calibrated color, low-light/moving-subject focus and video endurance.'),
 ('Telephoto camera', 'Working basics / partial', 'IMX351 preview, upright photo and LC898217XC lens movement verified. Near/far autofocus user-verified; faster correction installed persistently and retained after reboot. Roughly 40-second stream previously passed.', 'OIS, calibrated color, per-camera video quality/endurance and difficult-light focus.'),
 ('Front camera', 'Unresponsive / pre-existing fault', 'User reports failure in Android. Corrected CCI1 test receives no acknowledgement, including longer power/reset settling; other sensor on that bus works.', 'Verify physical supplies and module health. Linux test alone does not establish a hardware fault.'),
 ('Flashlight', 'Working basics', 'User confirms on/off and adjustable brightness.', 'Camera-synchronized flash remains unimplemented.'),
 ('Ambient light and proximity', 'Blocked', 'Neither sensor is exposed by the sensor firmware. Factory configuration trial did not restore them.', 'Determine firmware, board configuration or physical fault; automatic brightness and proximity blanking unavailable.'),
 ('Motion sensors', 'Partial', 'Real accelerometer motion and screen rotation verified. Magnetometer returns measurements; gyro and barometer discovered.', 'Compass calibration, gyro/barometer measurement accuracy and app integration.'),
 ('Fingerprint', 'Discovery and secure matching; stock unlock incomplete', 'Existing secure enrollment/reload and correct/wrong-finger matching verified. Native libfprint discovery recognizes the device. New account storage, enrollment and GNOME prompt bridge passed 16 storage and 19 process/routing tests on host and phone using synthetic data, plus 20 native enrollment fault cases. New GNOME setup-PIN path completed live enrollment and reload; same finger matched on retry after one false rejection, different finger rejected. System authentication unchanged.', 'Improve matching reliability and connect stock fprintd/Settings. Account-password lifecycle, multiple fingers, deletion and PIN fallback remain unvalidated; the new bridge is not installed for authentication.'),
 ('GNSS / location', 'Untested', 'No satellite-fix validation recorded.', 'Standalone position fix and location-service integration. Leave modem-related changes deferred.'),
 ('NFC', 'Partial', 'ISO14443 target detection and repeated controller start/stop passed after parser fix.', 'Tag data reading/writing, other protocols and emulation. Detection does not establish payment support.'),
 ('Haptics and logo light', 'Working basics', 'User felt vibration pulses. RGB channels, Rainbow app and screen-off behavior verified.', 'Color balance and power consumption; longer screen-state testing.'),
 ('microSD', 'Read/write check passed', '64 GB SDXC/exFAT detected. New 16 MiB temporary file written, synced and SHA256-verified on readback, then removed; existing files untouched. Write 1.028 seconds, read 0.217 seconds.', 'Sustained write endurance and suspend/reconnect reliability; this was a small bounded test.'),
 ('USB', 'Partial / physical issue', 'USB networking works; current gadget link is USB 2 high-speed. Host/dual-role, HID and mass-storage options are compiled in.', 'Known flaky physical port; USB host/OTG, role switching and external devices need tests. SuperSpeed is not enabled by the current gadget configuration.'),
