 ('Hardware video codecs', 'H.264 test passed', '60 synthetic 640x480 frames encoded and decoded by Venus through /dev/video13 and /dev/video12 in 0.524 seconds; 27,648,000 decoded bytes received.', 'Validate playback/recording application use, sustained high-resolution operation and other codecs.'),
 ('Buttons', 'Working basics', 'Power/wake and Volume/Power navigation in recovery user-verified.', 'Desktop volume adjustment and headset-button behavior remain unvalidated.'),
